<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat</p>
<p>weekly estimate, to January 8 of 1995/96 shipments (1996/97</p>
<p>wheat), 1995/96 export commitments (1996/97 wheat) and</p>
<p>purchases by exporters in indicated crop years (thousands of</p>
<p>tonnes).</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
<p> .............................................1995/96..1996/97</p>
<p> Bread wheat  2,405.5  6,200.0   Dec-Nov	4,888.7  3,971.5</p>
<p> Maize	  6,833.8  2,500.0   Mar-Feb	6,865.8    871.6</p>
<p> Sorghum	  665.7    670.0   Mar-Feb	  634.5     18.2</p>
<p> Soybeans     2,011.8  2,050.0   Apr-Mar	2,065.4    744.6</p>
<p> Sunseeds	 537.3    600.0   Jan-Dec	  583.2     15.9</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541-318-0650</p>
